<title>TURKEY: Turkey treasury changes Tuesday auction maturity.</title>
<headline>Turkey treasury changes Tuesday auction maturity.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury changed the maturity of papers to be auctioned on Tuesday to 399 days from previously announced 420 days (14 months).</p>
<p>New auction details are as follows;</p>
<p>    Maturity    : February 11, 1998</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: January 7, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : January 8, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
</text>
